    <!-- https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.kafka/kafka-clients

         Deliberately NOT tracking the broker version. This dependency is compile-scoped and
         goes unrelocated into the jar-with-dependencies published as
         hsfs-spark-spark4.1-<ver>.jar, which lands in /srv/hops/spark/hopsworks-jars/ - the
         same directory as the Spark image's own kafka-clients and the Hudi slim bundle's
         copy, both 3.9.1. hopsworks-ee puts that directory on extraClassPath as a single
         `hopsworks-jars/*` wildcard, so which copy loads is decided by directory listing
         order.

         That is harmless while the versions agree on API, and breaks when they do not:
         kafka-clients 4.x removed KafkaConsumer.poll(long), which Spark 4.1's
         KafkaOffsetReaderConsumer calls, and committed(TopicPartition), which Hudi's
         KafkaOffsetGen calls. With 4.3.1 here, whether a Spark streaming job or a Hudi
         streamer ran depended on file order.

         Nothing here needs a 4.x client. hsfs uses KafkaProducer and ProducerRecord;
         hsfs-spark, the only module that inherits this dependency (beam and flink exclude
         it), also uses KafkaConsumer.partitionsFor and beginningOffsets (HudiEngine),
         ConsumerRecord (DeltaStreamerKafkaSource), and the Serializer/Deserializer,
         Header and SerializationException types. All of these are available in both 3.9.x
         and 4.x - recheck this list before bumping. A 3.9.x client also talks to a 4.3.1
         broker perfectly well, since Kafka's client/broker compatibility runs both ways.
         3.9.2 rather than the image's 3.9.1 because it carries the CVE fix and is still
         API-identical.

         Raise this only together with the Spark image's kafka-clients and Hudi's bundled
         copy, or after kafka-clients stops being shaded into the assembly. -->
    <dependency>
      <groupId>org.apache.kafka</groupId>
      <artifactId>kafka-clients</artifactId>
      <version>${kafka.version}</version>
    </dependency>

    <dependency>
      <groupId>mysql</groupId>
      <artifactId>mysql-connector-java</artifactId>
      <version>8.0.33</version>
      <scope>test</scope>
    </dependency>

    <dependency>
      <groupId>com.zaxxer</groupId>
      <artifactId>HikariCP</artifactId>
      <version>4.0.3</version>
    </dependency>
  </dependencies>
</project>
